</tbody></table>
<h2>Dropper URLs</h2><p>URLs that wget or curl commands in the exploit requests download from (indicators to block; do not open them).</p><ul>
<li><code>http://45.74.7.227/collect/p2srun.php?w=p2s&lt;sensor&gt;</code>: 159 requests from 16 IPs</li>
<li><code>http://45.74.7.227/collect/p2srun.php?w=p2s&lt;sensor&gt;&amp;stage=diag&amp;u=$</code>: 76 requests from 13 IPs</li>
<li><code>http://45.74.7.227/collect/p2srun.php?w=p2s&lt;sensor&gt;&amp;stage=diag&amp;d=u%3D$</code>: 83 requests from 12 IPs</li>
<li><code>http://176.65.139.153/wget.sh</code>: 17 requests from 6 IPs</li>
<li><code>https://217.60.102.5/sh</code>: 3,561 requests from 4 IPs</li>
<li><code>https://pastebin.com/raw/wCYGVCBG</code>: 71 requests from 2 IPs</li>
<li><code>http://92.118.112.100/p</code>: 70 requests from 2 IPs</li>
<li><code>https://webhook.site/c8370342-2a5c-489c-a0d3-35930cc2bc54/be67d5f4e708</code>: 2 requests from 2 IPs</li>
<li><code>https://webhook.site/c8370342-2a5c-489c-a0d3-35930cc2bc54/c18e174d1e85</code>: 2 requests from 2 IPs</li>
<li><code>https://webhook.site/c8370342-2a5c-489c-a0d3-35930cc2bc54/3c5744c6208a</code>: 2 requests from 2 IPs</li>
<li><code>https://webhook.site/c8370342-2a5c-489c-a0d3-35930cc2bc54/baf153efbb95</code>: 2 requests from 2 IPs</li>
<li><code>https://webhook.site/c8370342-2a5c-489c-a0d3-35930cc2bc54/c33b9dad02d6</code>: 2 requests from 2 IPs</li>
<li><code>https://webhook.site/c8370342-2a5c-489c-a0d3-35930cc2bc54/fbb6474028eb</code>: 2 requests from 2 IPs</li>
